# CloudPulse ☁️
## Cloud Monitoring and Alert System

CloudPulse is a cloud engineering project designed to monitor server performance, visualize system metrics, and send automated alerts when performance thresholds are exceeded.

### Objectives
- Monitor cloud server health and performance.
- Visualize CPU, memory, and disk metrics.
- Configure automated alerts and email notifications.
- Explore infrastructure automation using Terraform.

### Technologies
- Amazon Web Services (AWS)
- Amazon EC2
- Amazon CloudWatch
- Amazon SNS
- Python
- Terraform
- GitHub

### Architecture
EC2 Server → CloudWatch Metrics → CloudWatch Alarms → Amazon SNS → Email Notification

### Project Status
🚧 In Progress — features will be implemented and tested step by step.

### Learning Outcomes
- Cloud infrastructure fundamentals
- Monitoring and alerting
- Identity and Access Management (IAM)
- Infrastructure as Code (IaC)

